cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this reconstructed implementation separately from the thesis and its historical experiments."
type: software
title: "Nanopore Basecalling Preprocessing Reconstructed Implementation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Behrooz-Zamanipour/nanopore-basecalling-preprocessing"
url: "https://github.com/Behrooz-Zamanipour/nanopore-basecalling-preprocessing"
authors:
  - family-names: "Zamanipour Ghohrood"
    given-names: "Behrooz"
abstract: >-
  AI-assisted reconstruction of a thesis pipeline comparing six read-wise
  preprocessing strategies for nanopore DNA basecalling using a fixed 1D CNN
  and CTC. The original historical Google Cloud source, data, trained weights,
  and experiment outputs are not included. This is not a verified reproduction
  of the numerical thesis results.
keywords:
  - nanopore
  - basecalling
  - signal preprocessing
  - CTC
  - DNA
